 847│     /// (committed outside its lease) is REFUSED — the signoff still STANDS, but the out-of-lease branch is
 848│     /// not auto-joined; a human reviews it. NEVER touches main (guarded in GitIsolation). Refusals are
 849│     /// surfaced on the board, never silent.
